# U47 f: Config view with Sub/allflame_exp_030: RebuildConfigControls on entry, syncControlValue,
# the header controls and the primary config set list, the section grid (diffs first, the
# multi-column placement at this width), the scroll bar and wheel scrolling (the controls move
# and clip), the search box (typing filters the sections; Ctrl+A, BACK clears it), the
# show-all toggle, Ctrl+F (selects the search box).
#! u47-import Sub/allflame_exp_030.xml
#! u47-expect-text u47 CONFIG total=
screen 1920 1080 dpi 1
fixture userdir=../u46/user
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 3
move 116 98
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 732 138
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 900 600
wheel down 3
frames 2
wheel up 1
frames 2
move 400 196
click LEFTBUTTON
type "res"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press a
key-up CTRL
press BACK
frames 2
move 650 196
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
move 900 600
key-down CTRL
press f
key-up CTRL
type "life"
frames 2
